  // Charles iMessage 2026-04-20 N17: per-SKU carve-out rate as a
  // fraction (0.03 = 3%). Drives the CARVE_OUT engine when wired.
  carveOutPercent    Decimal?  @db.Decimal(5, 4)
  // Roadmap track 10 (2026-04-20): annual price-escalator rate.
  // Stored as a fraction (0.03 = 3% annual increase). Null = fixed
  // price for the contract term. Applied by `escalatePrice()` in
  // lib/contracts/price-escalator.ts so display + variance math see
